  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix: SIGFPE when drawing grid by @yinghao-w in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/99\r\n* Update nix installation instructions by @Sporarum in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/81\r\n* Add bash completions (with some refactoring) by @adamtuft in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/80\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @yinghao-w made their first contribution in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/99\r\n* @Sporarum made their first contribution in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/81\r\n* @adamtuft made their first contribution in https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/pull/80\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/da-luce/astroterm/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0",
